This aircraft is derived from the "standard_vtol" simulation model that ships with
PX4-Autopilot (Tools/simulation/gz/models/standard_vtol), and carries that model's geometry,
mass, aerodynamic and propulsion data. The meshes are the source model's own,
converted to glTF.

